  lines:
  - text: The situation got worse way too quickly.
    hasChoices: 0
    choices: []
    isEnd: 0
  - text: "Now the interference is affecting sectors that weren\u2019t even connected
      to the main network."
    hasChoices: 0
    choices: []
    isEnd: 0
  - text: If we keep losing control of the systems, the entire campus could collapse.
    hasChoices: 0
    choices: []
    isEnd: 1
  - text: We need to discover the source of this technological contamination.
    hasChoices: 0
    choices: []
